Developed an interactive HR Analytics Dashboard using Power BI to analyze employee workforce data, attrition patterns, salary distribution, demographics, job roles, departments, and employee experience.

Project Overview

This project focuses on transforming raw HR data into actionable business insights through data cleaning, transformation, analysis, and visualization. The dashboard enables HR teams and decision-makers to monitor workforce trends and identify factors associated with employee attrition.

Key Analysis
Total Employees and Employee Attrition
Attrition Rate analysis
Average Monthly Income
Employee distribution by Age, Gender, Education, Department, and Job Role
Salary and income analysis
Years of experience and employee tenure
Department-wise workforce analysis
Identification of employee attrition patterns
Interactive filtering using Gender and Department slicers
Tools & Technologies
Power BI
Power Query
DAX
Data Cleaning & Transformation
Data Visualization
Business/HR Analytics
Key DAX Measures

Created calculated measures for important HR KPIs, including:

Employees Count
Employees Left
Attrition Rate
Average Monthly Income
Business Objective

The objective of the project is to help HR teams understand employee attrition, workforce composition, salary patterns, and departmental trends, enabling more data-driven workforce planning and retention strategies.
